  "releaseNotes": "BioLib 4.2.0 improves pyramidal image processing and tile loading:\n- Caches Fiji command options for pyramidal runs to avoid repeated prompts for each resolution level.\n- Fixes remote Zarr tile loading to use the requested Z, C, and T coordinates.\n- Replaces ImageSharp-based tile assembly with NetVips for 8-bit, 16-bit grayscale, and RGB images.\n- Updates BioFormats.NET6, CS-Script, and SkiaSharp dependencies.",
